OL,3,GNEWSABaby whose parents feared had just
OL,4,Adays to live is 'thriving' after
OL,5,Alife-saving heart operation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA baby, whose parents feared had just
OL,8,Fdays to live, is "thriving" after
OL,9,Fhaving life-saving operations on his
OL,10,Fheart.
OL,12,FMacs Green, a previously "completely
OL,13,Fhealthy baby" suffered two cardiac
OL,14,Farrests and was diagnosed with dilated
OL,15,Fcardiomyopathy - which can lead to
OL,16,Fheart failure.
OL,18,FAfter a struggle to find suitable
OL,19,Fhospital beds, he has now had device
OL,20,Fcalled a Berlin Heart, external fitted,
OL,21,Fwhich takes over the function of his
OL,22,Fheart.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
